# Session exports and story saves. These were listed one filename at a time, which meant the next
# session you started was neither tracked nor ignored, and one `git add .` away from publishing a
# personal transcript. Ignore every JSON at the repository root instead; the release builder uses
# its own allowlist, so nothing here affects a public download. Force-add with `git add -f` if a
# root JSON ever genuinely belongs in the repository.
/*.json
characters/*
!characters/example.md
sfx/
music/
ambience/
skins/
RP-PARTY-HARNESS-SUMMARY.md
HARNESS-REVIEW.md
